cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use CTA-QSAR in your research, please cite it as follows."
title: "CTA-QSAR: Chemically Trustworthy Agentic QSAR"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-08-19"
abstract: >-
  An agentic QSAR workbench in which an LLM-driven scientist iteratively
  selects representations, models, and validation strategies, and every
  proposal is subjected to predictive, generalization, applicability-domain,
  robustness, and uncertainty trust checks before being accepted into the
  final report.
authors:
